  "published": "2026-07-12T14:40:25.007Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 — Core-transport mode ([NatsService(Transport = NatsTransport.Core)]): at-most-once consumption over plain Core NATS with ZERO JetStream/$JS.API calls, for Core-only servers (started without -js). Fixes a host crash when a service ran against a Core-only server. Producer/RPC OpenTelemetry: every send starts an irkalla.nats.produce span and injects traceparent (producer→consumer trace continuity); producer metrics messages_produced/messages_produce_failed/produce_duration. Package icon. 0.1.0 — First release: attribute-based services ([NatsService]/[NatsMethod]), subject-token routing, JSON/Protobuf handlers, JetStream at-least-once delivery with redelivery backoff and DLQ (ErrorPolicy Skip/Dlq/Stop), native Core request-reply RPC (INatsRpcClient), typed producer (INatsProducer) + producer-only registration, consumer-side deduplication (Nats-Msg-Id + duplicate window), multi-assembly scanning, per-service consumer overrides, appsettings/IConfiguration binding + IOptions, consumer health check, net8.0/net10.0 multi-target, first-class auth/TLS options plus raw NATS.Net passthrough. NATS.Net 3.0.0.",
